sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant L as Leader (Node A)
    participant F1 as Follower (Node B)
    participant F2 as Follower (Node C)

    P->>L: publish message
    L->>F1: replicate
    L->>F2: replicate
    F1-->>L: ack (saved)
    Note over L,F1: Majority (2 of 3) confirmed →<br/>message "committed"
    L-->>P: confirm — safe now

    Note over L: ⚡ Leader (Node A) crashes
    F1->>F2: heartbeat missed — start Election
    F2->>F1: vote
    Note over F1,F2: Node B has most up-to-date data → becomes new Leader
    F1-->>P: new Leader ready, resume publishing

    Note over P,F2: কোনো committed মেসেজ হারায়নি —<br/>majority-তে আগে থেকেই ছিল
